{
  "title": "Nutty Kenyan Peppers Stew",
  "description": "A flavorful and nutritious stew featuring a mix of peppers, with a nutty twist from cashew cream. Perfect for a cozy dinner on a chilly night.",
  "cuisine": "kenyan",
  "diet": [
