  "instructions": [
    "Heat coconut oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add onion, garlic, and ginger, and cook until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add mixed peppers, cumin, coriander, salt, and black pepper, and cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Add soaked cashews, water, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce heat to low, cover, and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Blend the stew with an immersion blender or a regular blender until mostly smooth.",
    "Stir in fresh cilantro.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional cilantro if desired.",
    "Refrigerate or freeze for later use."
  ],
